  "details": "When running VRChat on PC, then starting it on mobile, you can be online with the same account two times at once.\n\nThis leads to all kind of weird issues, e.g. when people want to join you (which version of you do they join?). \n\nAt least you cannot join yourself, that pops up an error and kicks you out of the instance. I'd assume this possibility wasn't intended, so it is a bug.",
